WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.065 --> 00:00:05.701
Once upon a time, there was a queen.

2
00:00:05.702 --> 00:00:09.740
She was very kind.

3
00:00:09.741 --> 00:00:15.264
But her son was unkind.

4
00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:19.100
The queen gave people food.

5
00:00:19.101 --> 00:00:24.171
She helped the poor.

6
00:00:24.172 --> 00:00:31.949
The prince sent them away.

7
00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:41.131
One day a fairy was passing the castle.

8
00:00:41.132 --> 00:00:47.900
A man was asking the prince for help.

9
00:00:47.901 --> 00:00:52.073
"Please, sir. I need shelter."

10
00:00:52.074 --> 00:00:56.783
"Then build a house!" the prince snapped.

11
00:00:56.784 --> 00:01:00.013
Next a woman spoke to him.

12
00:01:00.014 --> 00:01:03.157
"Can you give me a few coins?"

13
00:01:03.158 --> 00:01:06.648
"Never!" the prince said.

14
00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:10.805
Fairy shook her head.

15
00:01:10.806 --> 00:01:16.230
"I know he lost his princess," she thought.

16
00:01:16.231 --> 00:01:20.981
"But I must teach him to be loving again."

17
00:01:20.982 --> 00:01:44.582
Poof! The fairy turned into an old woman.

18
00:01:44.583 --> 00:01:48.893
She went up to the prince.

19
00:01:48.894 --> 00:01:53.896
"Please sir, I am hungry."

20
00:01:53.897 --> 00:01:58.202
"Then buy some food!" the prince said.

21
00:01:58.203 --> 00:02:02.476
The woman pulled out a rose.

22
00:02:02.477 --> 00:02:07.229
"I'll pay you with this."

23
00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:12.324
"I don't want that," the prince said. "Then

24
00:02:12.325 --> 00:02:25.433
I'll use magic," Fairy said. She

25
00:02:25.434 --> 00:02:32.802
waved her wand— poof!

26
00:02:32.803 --> 00:02:38.297
"I've cursed everyone in your castle.

27
00:02:38.298 --> 00:02:42.176
The forest is cursed too."

28
00:02:42.177 --> 00:02:46.227
"What?" The prince was confused.

29
00:02:46.228 --> 00:02:49.646
The fairy lifted her wand again.

30
00:02:49.647 --> 00:02:52.351
"Now it’s your turn.

31
00:02:52.352 --> 00:03:00.175
You'll look as beastly as you act!"

32
00:03:00.176 --> 00:03:05.918
Poof! The prince turned into a terrible beast.

33
00:03:05.919 --> 00:03:09.508
Fairy smiled. "Perfect.

34
00:03:09.509 --> 00:03:12.737
I put my curse on you.

35
00:03:12.738 --> 00:03:17.416
Now you're as ugly as your heart."

36
00:03:17.417 --> 00:03:21.113
The prince looked down.

37
00:03:21.114 --> 00:03:24.693
He had sharp claws and dark fur.

38
00:03:24.694 --> 00:03:28.643
His ring seemed to glow with magic.

39
00:03:28.644 --> 00:03:38.956
"Turn me back into a prince!" He roared.

40
00:03:38.957 --> 00:03:44.326
Fairy shook her head and handed him the rose.

41
00:03:44.327 --> 00:03:48.885
"Only love can break my curse.

42
00:03:48.886 --> 00:03:54.434
Find true love before the rose's last petal falls.

43
00:03:54.435 --> 00:03:56.812
Or else . . ."

44
00:03:56.813 --> 00:04:00.676
"Or else what?" Prince asked.

45
00:04:00.677 --> 00:04:06.701
"You'll die a beast!"

46
00:04:06.702 --> 00:04:24.883
Poof! Fairy disappeared.

